{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan gate for mopey-living-viper: first review blocked on missing checklist/testing; remediated. Second blocked on incomplete check-class proof; broadened, then third review correctly found the deterministic unit test could not prove agentic finder behavior and that a blanket b2 waiver was unsafe. Final plan now uses the production eval_solver via rebar criteria eval T10 --runs 3 with balanced fire/no-fire controls plus offline contract tests. A tracker-comment quoting error accidentally invoked the absent eval once; it failed cleanly before any code or ticket-state change and was recorded on the ticket."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786552033649095001,"uuid":"d0ea8345-9c12-448f-808b-3129f4149851"}